<h1>MVC views in practice</h1>
<p>Open each example from the menu to try Razor, model binding and partial views.</p>
<div class="cards">
    <a class="card" asp-action="Data"><h2>Passing data</h2><p>ViewData, ViewBag, models, tuples and dynamic objects.</p></a>
    <a class="card" asp-action="Syntax"><h2>Razor syntax</h2><p>Expressions, conditions, loops and functions.</p></a>
    <a class="card" asp-controller="Form" asp-action="Index"><h2>Forms</h2><p>Submit and validate different HTML inputs.</p></a>
    <a class="card" asp-controller="Partial" asp-action="Index"><h2>Partial views</h2><p>Load data and submit a student without reloading.</p></a>
</div>
